1
00:05:19,285 --> 00:05:25,285
Fury is born.

2
00:10:38,571 --> 00:10:44,571
Furiosa: A Mad Max Saga is a action, science fiction,
adventure film directed by George Miller.

3
00:15:57,857 --> 00:16:03,857
As the world falls, young Furiosa is snatched from the Green Place of Many Mothers
into the hands of a great biker horde led by the warlord Dementus.

4
00:21:17,142 --> 00:21:23,142
Sweeping through the wasteland, they encounter the
citadel presided over by Immortan Joe.

5
00:26:36,428 --> 00:26:42,428
The two tyrants wage war for dominance, and Furiosa must survive many
trials as she puts together the means to find her way home.

6
00:31:55,714 --> 00:32:01,714
Furiosa, played by Anya Taylor-Joy.

7
00:37:15,000 --> 00:37:21,000
Dementus, played by Chris Hemsworth.

8
00:42:34,285 --> 00:42:40,285
Praetorian Jack, played by Tom Burke.

9
00:47:53,571 --> 00:47:59,571
Young Furiosa, played by Alyla Browne.

10
00:53:12,857 --> 00:53:18,857
The History Man, played by George Shevtsov.

11
00:58:32,142 --> 00:58:38,142
Immortan Joe / Rizzdale Pell, played by Lachy Hulme.

12
01:03:51,428 --> 01:03:57,428
Furiosa: A Mad Max Saga is a 2024 post-apocalyptic action film directed and
produced by George Miller, who wrote the screenplay with Nico Lathouris.

13
01:09:10,714 --> 01:09:16,714
It is the fifth installment in the Mad Max franchise, and the first not focused on Max Rockatansky,
instead a spinoff prequel to Mad Max: Fury Road (2015) and an origin story for Furiosa.

14
01:14:30,000 --> 01:14:36,000
Starring Anya Taylor-Joy and Alyla Browne as said character and set years before Fury Road, the film follows her life for over a
decade, from her kidnapping by the forces of warlord Dementus (Chris Hemsworth) to her ascension to the rank of Imperator.

15
01:19:49,285 --> 01:19:55,285
Tom Burke also stars as Praetorian Jack, a military
commander who befriends Furiosa.

16
01:25:08,571 --> 01:25:14,571
Several Fury Road cast members return in supporting roles, including John
Howard, Nathan Jones, and Angus Sampson reprising their characters.

17
01:30:27,857 --> 01:30:33,857
The film begins in what can be seen as a green paradise of a solarpunk future and quickly
moves to the more traditional dieselpunk, which this franchise is known for.

18
01:35:47,142 --> 01:35:53,142
Miller initially intended to shoot Furiosa back-to-back with Fury Road, but the former spent
several years in development hell amidst salary disputes with Warner Bros.

19
01:41:06,428 --> 01:41:12,428
Pictures, Fury Road's distributor.

20
01:46:25,714 --> 01:46:31,714
Several crew members from Fury Road returned for Furiosa, including Lathouris, producer Doug Mitchell,
composer Tom Holkenborg, costume designer Jenny Beavan, and editor Margaret Sixel (Miller's wife).

21
01:51:45,000 --> 01:51:51,000
Filming took place in Australia from June to October 2022.

22
01:57:04,285 --> 01:57:10,285
Furiosa: A Mad Max Saga premiered at the 77th
Cannes Film Festival on 15 May 2024.

23
02:02:23,571 --> 02:02:29,571
It was released theatrically in Australia on 23 May 2024
and in the United States the following day.

24
02:07:42,857 --> 02:07:48,857
The film received highly positive reviews from
critics and multiple award nominations.

25
02:13:02,142 --> 02:13:08,142
It was named one of the Top Ten Films of 2024 by the National Board of Review, but was a
box-office bomb, grossing $174.4 million against its budget of $168 million.

26
02:18:21,428 --> 02:18:27,428
The film explores themes of chase, post-apocalyptic
future, warlord, prequel, wasteland.

27
02:23:40,714 --> 02:23:46,714
The tone is thought_provoking.
